            >barons</hi>. <hi rend="bold">B</hi>: <hi rend="italic">conselle</hi>.</p></note>
        <note type="tnote" n="19">247<space rend="indent1"/><p><hi rend="italic">and</hi>. <hi
              rend="bold">A</hi>: <hi rend="italic">an</hi>.</p></note>
        <note type="tnote" n="20">250<space rend="indent1"/><p><hi rend="italic">falsenesse to
              torne</hi>. <hi rend="bold">A</hi>: <hi rend="italic">falsenesse
