        <note type="tnote" n="37">550<space rend="indent1"/><p><hi rend="italic">solas</hi>. Erasure
            of one letter in <hi rend="bold">A</hi> after this word.</p></note>
        <note type="tnote" n="38">557<space rend="indent1"/><p><hi rend="italic">light</hi>. <hi
              rend="bold">A</hi>: <hi rend="italic">liȝ</hi>.</p></note>
        <note type="tnote" n="39">567<space rend="indent1"/><p><hi rend="italic">Seste</hi>. Erasure
